  "description": "Monitors Pod CPU utilization using pod_cpu_usage_seconds_total and container_cpu_usage_seconds_total, correlated directly with host Node CPU metrics to identify whether performance bottlenecks originate from individual Pods or host Node resource exhaustion.",
